me":{"original":"command_execution","canonical":"shell"},"input":{"state":"complete","value":{"command":"/bin/bash -lc \"rg -n \\\"opentelemetry|OpenTelemetry|langsmith|openinference|openllmetry|feature.?flag|flags\\\" . --glob '\"'!niceeval/node_modules/**'\"' --glob '\"'!frontend/node_modules/**'\"' --glob '\"'!**/__pycache__/**'\"' | head -160\""}},"output":{"state":"complete","value":{"output":"./niceeval/package-lock.json:3752:        \"@opentelemetry/exporter-trace-otlp-http\": \">=0.200.0\",\n./niceeval/package-lock.json:3753:        \"@opentelemetry/sdk-trace-node\": \">=2.0.0\",\n./niceeval/package-lock.json:3764:        \"@opentelemetry/exporter-trace-otlp-http\": {\n./niceeval/package-lock.json:3767:        \"@opentelemetry/sdk-trace-node\": {\n./deep_agents/benchmark_results/breadth_2026-07-04_22-39-24.json:590:      \"prompt\": \"Write a 'state of the stack, mid-2026' briefing for a CTO: a single wide-coverage report on where the AI and web engineering ecosystem stands right now. Cover: (1) OpenAI's current API model lineup and pricing - flagship and mid-tier models, exact model names, per-token prices, reasoning options; (2) the LangChain 1.x ecosystem - current versions, the modern agent-building API, what replaced the legacy patterns, and the runtime layer; (3) the deepagents library - current version and its core APIs for agents, subagents, filesystem backends and human-in-the-loop; (4) Next.js - the current major version, runtime requirements, key breaking changes and build tooling. Be specific about versions, names and prices, and cite sources.\",\n./deep_agents/benchmark_results/breadth_2026-07-04_22-39-24.json:704:        \"report\": \"# State of the stack, mid-2026\\nA CTO briefing on the AI + web engineering ecosystem\\n\\n## Executive summary\\n\\nBy mid-2026, the stack has clarified into layers:\\n\\n- **Model providers** are segmenting into flagship general models, cheaper mini/nano variants, and explicit reasoning models/options.\\n- **LangChain 1.x** has finished its architectural reset: `create_agent` is now the standard entrypoint, legacy chains/retrievers moved to `langchain-classic`, and **LangGraph** is the runtime layer underneath.  \\n- **Deep Agents** has emerged as a higher-level \\u201cagent harness\\u201d on top of LangChain + LangGraph, bundling planning, subagents, filesystem access, permissions, summarization, and HITL.  \\n- **Next.js 16** is the current stable generation, with **Turbopack now the default bundler**, Node 20.9+ required, and several long-signaled cleanup changes now enforced.\\n\\nThe main strategic pattern is now clear: **use LangChain for portable agent abstractions, LangGraph for runtime/orchestration, Deep Agents for batteries-included agent apps, and Next.js 16 for frontend/server integration when you want a unified React platform.**\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1) OpenAI API lineup and pricing\\n\\n### What appears current in mid-2026\\n\\nOpenAI\\u2019s current ecosystem appears split across:\\n\\n- **Flagship general-purpose GPT-5 family**\\n- **Cheaper GPT-5 mini / nano tiers**\\n- **Reasoning-oriented families and options**, including `o4-mini` and `o3`\\n- **Reasoning controls** such as `reasoning_effort`\\n\\nOpenAI-hosted docs are the authoritative source for model naming and behavior, but the search tooling did not surface the official pricing page reliably. I was able to ground model naming and reasoning behavior in OpenAI-hosted docs, and pricing via a secondary source that explicitly mirrors OpenAI pricing and cites the OpenAI pricing page. I\\u2019m marking that distinction clearly.\\n\\n### Model names and roles\\n\\nDeep Agents and LangChain docs both show current OpenAI model naming examples such as `openai:gpt-5.5`, which is useful as ecosystem evidence that GPT-5.x naming is now in active use:\\n- Deep Agents overview example using `openai:gpt-5.5`:  \\n  https://docs.langchain.com/oss/python/deepagents/overview\\n- LangChain v1 example middleware code also references `gpt-5.5`, `gpt-5-nano`, and `gpt-5.4-mini`:  \\n  https://docs.langchain.com/oss/python/releases/langchain-v1\\n\\nFor reasoning controls, OpenAI documentation was not directly retrievable in search, but ecosystem and forum references indicate current support for `reasoning_effort` levels across GPT-5-era models, with newer GPT-5-series models supporting richer settings including `xhigh` on some later variants:\\n- OpenAI community discussion referencing official docs behavior for `reasoning_effort`:  \\n  https://community.openai.com/t/request-for-compatibility-matrix-reasoning-effort-sampling-parameters-across-gpt-5-series/1371738\\n\\n### Pricing snapshot\\n**Caveat:** the exact prices below come from a secondary source that states it verified against OpenAI\\u2019s pricing page. I could not directly fetch the official OpenAI pricing page through search during this run, so treat these as **high-confidence but not directly fetched from OpenAI**.\\n\\nSecondary mirror:\\n- https://pecollective.com/tools/openai-api-pricing\\n\\nReported prices:\\n\\n| Model | Input / 1M tokens | Output / 1M tokens | Notes |\\n|---|---:|---:|---|\\n| `gpt-5` | $1.25 | $10.00 | Flagship general model |\\n| `gpt-5-mini` | $0.25 | $2.00 | Mid-tier / cost-optimized |\\n| `gpt-5-nano` | $0.05 | $0.40 | Lowest-cost tier |\\n| `o4-mini` | $1.10 | $4.40 | Reasoning-optimized small model |\\n| `gpt-4.1` | $2.00 | $8.00 | Still available but no longer the newest flagship |\\n| `gpt-4.1-mini` | $0.40 | $1.60 | Previous-gen cost tier |\\n| `gpt-4.1-nano` | $0.10 | $0.40 | Previous-gen ultra-cheap tier |\\n\\nThe same mirror also notes **cached input discounts** for some models, e.g. GPT-4.1 with a 75% cached-input discount. Because I could not fetch OpenAI\\u2019s own pricing page directly, I would verify cache pricing before budgeting.\\n\\n### Reasoning options\\n\\nThe key practical shift is that reasoning is no longer just \\u201cpick a reasoning model\\u201d; it is increasingly **a tunable runtime behavior**:\\n\\n- Some GPT-5-series models support `reasoning_effort`\\n- Later GPT-5-era models appear to support values like:\\n  - `none`\\n  - `low`\\n  - `medium`\\n  - `high`\\n  - on some newer variants, `xhigh`\\n\\nSource indicating that model support varies by generation:\\n- https://community.openai.com/t/request-for-compatibility-matrix-reasoning-effort-sampling-parameters-across-gpt-5-series/1371738\\n\\n### CTO take\\n\\nUse the lineup like this:\\n\\n- **`gpt-5`**: default high-quality general model when quality matters more than cost\\n- **`gpt-5-mini`**: the likely default for production agent workloads needing good cost/quality\\n- **`gpt-5-nano`**: classification, routing, extraction, guardrails, cheap copilots\\n- **`o4-mini` / `o3`-style reasoning**: hard math, coding, planning, verification, agent subproblems\\n- **`reasoning_effort`**: treat as a latency/cost knob, not a marketing feature\\n\\n### Risk note\\n\\nI could not directly retrieve the official OpenAI pricing page in this session. For procurement or budgeting, re-check OpenAI\\u2019s live pricing page before committing numbers.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2) LangChain 1.x ecosystem\\n\\n### Current package state\\n\\nPyPI shows these current releases:\\n\\n- **`langchain`** latest release: Jun 22, 2026  \\n  https://pypi.org/project/langchain\\n- **`langgraph`** latest release: Jun 29, 2026  \\n  https://pypi.org/project/langgraph\\n- **`langchain-core`** latest release: Jun 18, 2026  \\n  https://pypi.org/project/langchain-core\\n- **`langchain-classic`** latest release: Jun 10, 2026  \\n  https://pypi.org/project/langchain-classic\\n\\nThe docs position **LangChain v1** as the production-ready base for building agents:\\n- LangChain v1 release notes:  \\n  https://docs.langchain.com/oss/python/releases/langchain-v1\\n\\n### The modern API: `create_agent`\\n\\nThe central fact in LangChain 1.x is:\\n\\n- **`langchain.agents.create_agent` is now the standard API**\\n- It **replaces** the older `langgraph.prebuilt.create_react_agent`\\n\\nOfficial source:\\n- https://docs.langchain.com/oss/python/releases/langchain-v1\\n\\nThe docs state explicitly:\\n- \\\"`create_agent` is the standard way to build agents in LangChain 1.0\\\"\\n- it replaces `langgraph.prebuilt.create_react_agent`\\n- middleware is the main customization mechanism\\n\\n### What replaced legacy patterns\\n\\nLangChain 1.x deliberately reduced the surface area of the core package.\\n\\nWhat moved out:\\n\\n- legacy chains and chain implementations\\n- retrievers from the old `langchain.retrievers`\\n- indexing API\\n- hub module\\n- deprecated/community exports\\n\\nThose now live in:\\n- **`langchain-classic`**\\n\\nOfficial source:\\n- https://docs.langchain.com/o","exit_code":0}},"command":{"kind":"command","original":{"state":"opaque","reason":"unsupported-protocol"},"logical":{"state":"opaque","normalizer":"logical-command/v1","reason":"original-opaque","originalReason":"unsupported-protocol"}},"start":{"turnOrdinal":1,"eventOrdinal":46},"lifecycle":{"state":"available","status":"completed","finish":{"turnOrdinal":1,"eventOrdinal":47}}},{"id":"[\"niceeval.logical-tool-occurrence/1\",\"session-1\",\"turn-2\",2,4]","session":"session-1","turn":"turn-2","name":{"original":"command_execution","canonical":"shell"},"input":{"state":"complete","value":{"command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '1,300p' node_modules/niceeval/docs-site/zh/tutorials/write-experiment.mdx && sed -n '1,360p' node_modules/niceeval/docs-site/zh/tutorials/authoring.mdx\""}},"output":{"state":"complete","value":{"output":"---\ntitle: \"实验与生命周期\"\nsidebarTitle: \"实验\"\ndescription: \"如何写好实验。选择 Agent、传递 model 和 flags，设置 attempts、预算、并发与 Sandbox，并用 setup / teardown 起停实验级共享服务。\"\n---\n\nExperiment 是可签入的运行配置：同一批评估用例对着哪个 adapter、哪个模型、开哪些 flags、跑几次、预算多少，都写在 `experiments/` 里。CLI 的位置参数只负责筛评估用例，不负责临时改 agent 或运行配置。\n\n## 最小实验\n\n```ts\n// experiments/local.ts\nimport { defineExperiment } from \"niceeval\";\nimport { webAgent } from \"../agents/web-agent.ts\";\n\nexport default defineExperiment({\n  agent: webAgent({ baseUrl: \"http://127.0.0.1:5188\" }),\n});\n```\n\n`agent` 放的是已经配置好的 agent 实例。被测系统的 URL、鉴权、协议细节通常传给 adapter 工厂。运行器不会单独保存一个 `agentConfig` 字段。\n\n## 评估不同的 System Prompt 对于 Agent 的影响\n使用 flag 机制，配置不同的 Flag，设置两个实验，对比不同 Prompt 的区别。两格之间**只差一个变量**（这里是 `flags.promptVariant`），其余字段逐字相同——差别越少，分数差能归因到的东西越明确：\n\n```ts\n// experiments/prompts/v1.ts\nimport { defineExperiment } from \"niceeval\";\nimport { webAgent } from \"../../agents/web-agent.ts\";\n\nexport default defineExperiment({\n  description: \"System Prompt v1（基线）\",\n  agent: webAgent({\n    baseUrl: \"https://staging.example.com\",\n  }),\n  model: \"gpt-5.4\",\n  flags: {\n    promptVariant: \"v1\",     // ← 唯一的变量\n  },\n  attempts: 1,\n  budget: 5,\n});\n```\n\n```ts\n// experiments/prompts/v2.ts\nimport { defineExperiment } from \"niceeval\";\nimport { webAgent } from \"../../agents/web-agent.ts\";\n\nexport default defineExperiment({\n  description: \"System Prompt v2（对比）\",\n  agent: webAgent({\n    baseUrl: \"https://staging.example.com\",\n  }),\n  model: \"gpt-5.4\",\n  flags: {\n    promptVariant: \"v2\",     // ← 唯一的变量\n  },\n  attempts: 1,\n  budget: 5,\n});\n```\n\n两格写成同一个 `flags`（或模型对比里两格钉同一个 `model`，包括两格都写成同一个环境变量默认值）是最常见的失误：跑得完、报告也出得来，但两列数字比的是同一套配置，看不出任何东西。\n\n\n`model` 会作为 `ctx.model` 传给 Adapter。如果你的 Agent 支持模型选择，自己构建请求\n\n`flags` 会作为 `ctx.flags` 传给 Adapter，也会作为 `t.flags` 出现在评估用例里。\n\n语义就是产品 A/B 测试里的 feature flag，应该编写 Adapter 把 Flag 发给你的 Agent，Agent 根据 Flag 切换不同的 System Prompt 或者行为。\n\n```ts\n// agents/web-agent.ts\nasync send(input, ctx) {\n  await fetch(`${baseUrl}/api/turn`, {\n    method: \"POST\",\n    headers: { \"content-type\": \"application/json\" },\n    body: JSON.stringify({\n      message: input.text,\n      model: ctx.model,\n      flags: ctx.flags,\n    }),\n    signal: ctx.signal,\n  });\n}\n```\n\n## 编写一组实验\n\n一个实验文件是一格配置。要比较多个模型、agent 或 flag 取值，就写多个文件。目录只负责 id：\n\n```text\nexperiments/\n  prompts/baseline.ts\n  prompts/concise.ts\n  retrieval/with-retrieval.ts\n```\n\n```bash\nnpx niceeval exp prompts\n```\n\n报告直接比较当前 Scope 中的这些 experiments，不需要额外分组字段。\n\n只想验证某一个配置时，把位置参数写成该配置的完整 id：\n\n```bash\nnpx niceeval exp prompts/concise\n```\n\n用于逐配置排查——确认某一格改动是否达标，不用先跑完整组，也不用把其它配置文件挪出目录。\n\n## 常用字段\n\n| 字段 | 用途 |\n|---|---|\n| `agent` | 选择并配置 adapter。必填 |\n| `model` | 单个模型名，经 `ctx.model` 透传 |\n| `reasoningEffort` | 单个推理努力程度（如 `\"high\"`），经 `ctx.reasoningEffort` / `t.reasoningEffort` 透传，归属与 `model` 一致 |\n| `flags` | 实验条件（A/B 里的 feature flag），任意 JSON 对象，经 `ctx.flags` / `t.flags` 透传 |\n| `attempts` | 每个评估用例 × 配置最多跑几次 |\n| `earlyExit` | 多次运行里通过一次就提前停止。默认关，`attempts` 默认跑满测完整通过率 |\n| `evals` | `\"*\"`、id 前缀数组，或遍历只读 eval 描述并返回 boolean 的函数 |\n| `timeoutMs` | 单个 attempt 的超时 |\n| `budget` | 这一格配置的预算上限 |\n| `maxConcurrency` | 这一格配置的并发上限 |\n| `sharedState` | 跨 Invocation 共享 checkpoint 的独占 key。只协调状态，不提供存储 |\n| `sandbox` | 一条 `SandboxLayer`。具体 factory 一次声明 provider 原生 template，并可链 `.prepare()` / `.setup()` / `.teardown()` |\n| `plugins` | 显式附着的 NiceEval Plugin occurrence；把一套 identity、flags、Sandbox 命令、生命周期或 Agent Extension 作为完整条件复用 |\n| `setup` | 实验级 Hook：整个实验只跑一次、在你自己的机器上执行，启动全部 Attempt 共享的服务（见下） |\n| `teardown` | 与 `setup` 成对的实验级 Hook：全部 Attempt 收尾后执行一次，当且仅当 `setup` 的时点已经走到（见下） |\n\n## 传递运行时地址，又不让它作废缓存\n\n`flags` 写的是实验条件，它整袋参与缓存判定：值一变，已经跑完的结果就要重跑。所以隧道地址不要写进 `flags`——隧道每次重启换一个 URL，写进去就等于每次重启都作废全部已完成结果。\n\n这个地址是 `setup` 跑起来才拿到的。把它留在生命周期闭包里，再由 Agent 工厂或 Sandbox Hook 使用；它不是实验条件，也没有通用 API 把它写成报告字段：\n\n```ts\nlet endpoint: string | undefined;\n\nexport default defineExperiment({\n  agent: nowledgeAgent(() => ({ url: endpoint! })),\n  sandbox: e2bSandbox({ template: \"niceeval-agents\" })\n    .setup(async sandbox => {\n      await sandbox.writeText(\".nowledge/env\", `NMEM_URL=${endpoint!}\\n`);\n    }),\n  async setup(ctx) {\n    endpoint = (await nowledgeTunnel({ signal: ctx.signal })).url;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n换了 URL 再跑，已完成的照常复用，只跑还缺的：\n\n```bash\n$ pnpm exec niceeval exp compare/codex--nowledge\n╭─ PLAN ──────────────────────────────────────────╮\n│ 36 attempts · 36 evals × 1 configs              │\n│ 24 of 36 reuse from cache · 12 to run           │\n╰─────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\n```\n\n地址只服务本次运行。复用进来的结果也不会被这次的新 URL 改写；需要比较的长期条件应当声明成稳定的实验配置。\n\n服务端版本号则相反：写成 `flags: { memoryVersion: \"0.10.39\" }`，换了版本行为可能真的不一样，那种变化就该让结果重跑。判据是**它是否是可比较的实验条件**：是就写 `flags`；只是本次连接坐标，就放在生命周期代码或外部服务配置里。没有通用回调、自定义数据族或注册点可把任意值写进结果。Adapter 和评估用例都不需要读、只给报告分组用的标注写 `labels`。\n\n## 启动 Experiment 共享服务\n\n有些资源是「一个实验一份、所有 Attempt 共用」的：一条到内网记忆服务的隧道、一个实验专用的 mock server、一个 license 租约。这类资源写进一对实验级 Hook `setup` / `teardown`：整场至多各跑一次。`setup` 在这个实验第一个要派发的 Attempt 前执行。`teardown` 在全部 Attempt 收尾后执行（运行被中断也执行），当且仅当 `setup` 的时点已经走到才触发——`setup` 抛错同样要走到 `teardown`，收尾代码要对可能未赋值的变量做防御。上一次的结果全部被复用、这个实验一个 Attempt 都不需要真正运行时，`setup` 和 `teardown` 都不会执行：\n\n```ts\n// setup 拿到的地址、密钥放模块变量：teardown 和同文件里的 agent（每个 Attempt 都会执行、晚于 setup）直接读它。\nlet tunnel: { url: string; apiKey: string; st","exit_code":0}},"command":{"kind":"command","original":{"state":"opaque","reason":"unsupported-protocol"},"logical":{"state":"opaque","normalizer":"logical-command/v1","reason":"original-opaque","originalReason":"unsupported-protocol"}},"start":{"turnOrdinal":2,"eventOrdinal":4},"lifecycle":{"state":"available","status":"completed","finish":{"turnOrdinal":2,"eventOrdinal":5}}},{"id":"[\"niceeval.logical-tool-occurrence/1\",\"session-1\",\"turn-2\",2,6]","session":"session-1","turn":"turn-2","name":{"original":"command_execution","canonical":"shell"},"input":{"state":"complete","value":{"command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '1,360p' node_modules/niceeval/docs-site/zh/tutorials/connect-your-agent.mdx && sed -n '1,420p' node_modules/niceeval/docs-site/zh/tutorials/write-send.mdx\""}},"output":{"state":"complete","value":{"output":"---\ntitle: \"接入你的 Agent\"\nsidebarTitle: \"接入 Agent\"\ndescription: \"写一个 Adapter、配置一个 Experiment，并运行第一条评估用例。再把配置和参数从 Experiment 传给 Adapter 与被测应用。\"\n---\n\n把一个被测对象接入 [NiceEval](https://niceeval.com/) 需要一个 **Adapter**。`defineAgent` 构造直接调用函数、SDK 或服务端点的 Adapter。它的 `send` 接收输入、驱动 Agent，并返回本轮结果。\n\n本教程先用 Adapter、Experiment 和评估用例跑通最小接入，再说明参数从 Experiment 到 Adapter 和被测应用的传递路径。事件流、多轮、HITL 与 tracing 属于可选能力，文末列出对应教程。\n\n## 按被测对象选择接入方式\n\n<CardGroup cols={3}>\n  <Card title=\"AI SDK 应用\" icon=\"bolt\" href=\"/zh/reference/builtin-agents\">\n    Vercel AI SDK 应用可使用内置适配器连接现有 HTTP 接口。\n  </Card>\n  <Card title=\"Agent\" icon=\"terminal\" href=\"/zh/tutorials/sandbox-agent\">\n    评估 Claude Code / Codex / bub 这种独立的 Agent：用内置 Sandbox Agent。\n  </Card>\n  <Card title=\"其它 AI Agent\" icon=\"plug\">\n    自己的 Agent 需要 [编写 Send](/zh/tutorials/write-send)。如应用已有 OTel 埋点，可 [接入OTel ](/zh/tutorials/connect-otel)\n  </Card>\n</CardGroup>\n\n## 最小接入示例\n\n以下步骤假设项目已经运行 `npx niceeval init`，并包含 `niceeval.config.ts` 和 `evals/` 目录。三个文件各有一项职责：**Adapter 连接被测系统，Experiment 固定运行配置，评估用例定义交互和断言。**\n\n**1. 写 Adapter。** 最小接入只填 `status` 和 `events`，把 Agent 回复放进一条 `message` 事件。\n\n```ts\n// agents/my-agent.ts\nimport { completeEvidenceCoverage, defineAgent } from \"niceeval/adapter\";\n\nexport default defineAgent({\n  name: \"my-agent\",\n  evidenceCoverage: completeEvidenceCoverage,\n  async send(input, ctx) {\n    // 示例地址：换成你自己 agent 的真实端点（HTTP、CLI、SDK 都行，只要 send 里能拿到回复文本）\n    const r = await fetch(\"http://localhost:3000/chat\", {\n      method: \"POST\",\n      headers: { \"content-type\": \"application/json\" },\n      body: JSON.stringify({ message: input.text, model: ctx.model }),  // ← experiment.model 经 ctx.model 到这里\n      signal: ctx.signal,\n    });\n    const body = await r.json();\n    return {\n      status: r.ok ? \"completed\" : \"failed\",\n      events: [{ type: \"message\", role: \"assistant\", text: body.reply }],\n    };\n  },\n});\n```\n\n最小示例先使用固定 URL。需要按环境传入 URL 时，使用下文的[参数传递方式](#实验-flag)。`send` 的完整契约（`TurnInput` / `AgentContext` / `Turn` 各字段）见 [Adapter](/zh/explanation/adapter)。\n\n如果被测对象是独立的 HTTP 服务，即使服务代码和评估用例位于同一个代码库，也应通过线上实际使用的 HTTP 接口调用，不要把本例的 `fetch` 换成进程内函数调用，因为\n- **代码内部调用不是用户走的那条链路。** HTTP 层、序列化、中间件、流式传输全被绕过，评估用例通过不代表线上行为正确。\n- **Adapter 无法复用于其它部署环境。** HTTP Adapter 只需更换 `baseUrl`，即可连接本地、预发或生产环境（见下文两个 Experiment 文件）。进程内调用依赖当前代码库。\n\n如果 Agent 只提供 SDK、函数或 CLI，就在 `send` 中直接调用对应入口。保留前面相同的输入、取消信号和 `Turn` 返回形状；不要为了套用 HTTP 示例额外搭一个并不存在的服务。\n\n**2. 实验**\n\n```ts\n// experiments/my-agent.ts\nimport { defineExperiment } from \"niceeval\";\nimport myAgent from \"../agents/my-agent.ts\";\n\nexport default defineExperiment({\n  description: \"my-agent 基线\",\n  agent: myAgent,\n  model: \"gpt-4o\",\n  attempts: 1,\n});\n```\n\n**3. 评估用例**\n\n```ts\n// evals/refund-policy.eval.ts\nimport { defineEval } from \"niceeval\";\nimport { includes } from \"niceeval/expect\";\n\nexport default defineEval({\n  judge: true,\n  description: \"退款政策问答\",\n  async test(t) {\n    const turn = await t.send(\"你们的退款政策是什么?\");\n    turn.succeeded().label(\"请求成功\");\n    t.check(turn.message, includes(\"30\")).label(\"说明退款期限\");\n    turn.judge.autoevals.closedQA(\"回答是否说明了退款期限？\")\n      .gate(0.7)\n      .label(\"退款政策质量\");\n  },\n});\n```\n\n断言那行的写法是重点，别照抄成 `includes(\"30 天\")`：回答的措辞每次都不一样，用单一精确短语卡开放式回答，被测系统答对了也会红。措辞开放的内容有三条路子——多措辞等价的正则、形状断言（`includesUrl()` / `hasSections()`），或 `t.judge` 的语义判定。确定性的结果（具体数值、ID）才用精确断言。完整取舍见[题型与断言](/zh/tutorials/evaluation-kinds)。\n\n```bash\nnpx niceeval exp my-agent        # 跑这个 experiment 下的全部 eval\nnpx niceeval exp my-agent refund # 只跑 ID 以 refund 开头的\npnpm exec niceeval view --experiment my-agent  # 本地查看器里看结果\n```\n\n**验证运行结果**：终端会显示动态 dashboard，完成和排队数量在原位更新。失败、错误和 warning 会保留在输出中。运行结束后会打印摘要和 receipt；用其中的 Run ID 也可以执行 `pnpm exec niceeval view --run <runId>`，查看每条评估用例逐轮的输入、事件和评分明细。\n\n没跑通时，按报错的位置分三类排查：\n\n- **`fetch` 直接抛错**（连接被拒等）：应用没起来，或 `send` 里的 URL 不对——先用 `curl` 对那个接口发一次同样的请求确认。\n- **`t.succeeded()` 没过、本轮判定是 failed**：请求发出去了，但应用返回的 Turn 是 `failed`。把协议中的失败映射到 `Turn.status` 或标准 `error` event。需要额外保留的有限上下文用 `ctx.diagnostic(...)`，不要打印完整响应体。\n- **只有内容断言没过**：接入本身已经通了——在 `view` 里对照 `t.reply` 的实际值，调断言或调应用。\n\n完成这些步骤后，文本断言和 Judge 评分即可使用。工具、多轮和审批流断言需要继续添加文末列出的可选能力。\n\n## 实验 Flag\n\n配置归属只有两条通道，分清它们，接入就不会乱：\n\n1. **静态配置走 Adapter 工厂。** URL、鉴权和协议细节等环境级配置作为工厂参数写在 Experiment 文件里。`defineExperiment` 的 `agent` 字段接收**已经配置好的实例**。\n2. **每轮动态值走 `ctx`。** experiment 声明的 `model`、`flags`，运行器每轮经 `ctx` 原样递给 `send`。Adapter 不解释它们的含义，只随请求转发给应用。\n\n把第一步的 `my-agent` 从固定 URL 的实例改成接收配置的工厂。将 default export 改为返回 `defineAgent(...)` 的函数，并让 `send` 读取工厂参数。Experiment 声明的 `model` 和 `flags` 每轮经 `ctx` 到达，再由 `send` 随请求转发：\n\n```ts\n// agents/my-agent.ts —— 工厂：静态配置进闭包\nimport { completeEvidenceCoverage, defineAgent } from \"niceeval/adapter\";\nimport type { Agent } from \"niceeval/adapter\";\n\nexport function myAgent(options: { baseUrl: string }): Agent {\n  return defineAgent({\n    name: \"my-agent\",\n    evidenceCoverage: completeEvidenceCoverage,\n    async send(input, ctx) {\n      const r = await fetch(`${options.baseUrl}/chat`, {   // ← 工厂配置：连哪\n        method: \"POST\",\n        headers: { \"content-type\": \"application/json\" },\n        body: JSON.stringify({\n          message: input.text,\n          model: ctx.model,     // ← experiment.model：应用接口收模型选择就转发\n          flags: ctx.flags,   // ← experiment.flags：原样交给应用，应用按参数切换\n        }),\n        signal: ctx.signal,     // ← 运行器的超时与取消：挂到每个请求上\n      });\n      const body = await r.json();\n      return {\n        status: r.ok ? \"completed\" : \"failed\",\n        events: [{ type: \"message\", role: \"assistant\", text: body.reply }],\n      };\n    },\n  });\n}\n```\n\n鉴权 header、协议开关这类同属静态配置，一样加进 `opt","exit_code":0}},"command":{"kind":"command","original":{"state":"opaque","reason":"unsupported-protocol"},"logical":{"state":"opaque","normalizer":"logical-command/v1","reason":"original-opaque","originalReason":"unsupported-protocol"}},"start":{"turnOrdinal":2,"eventOrdinal":6},"lifecycle":{"state":"available","status":"completed","finish":{"turnOrdinal":2,"eventOrdinal":7}}},{"id":"[\"niceeval.logical-tool-occurrence/1\",\"session-1\",\"turn-2\",2,8]","session":"session-1","turn":"turn-2","name":{"original":"command_execution","canonical":"shell"},"input":{"state":"complete","value":{"command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '1,320p' node_modules/niceeval/docs-site/zh/reference/define-agent.mdx && sed -n '1,320p' node_modules/niceeval/docs-site/zh/reference/events.mdx\""}},"output":{"state":"complete","value":{"output":"---\ntitle: \"defineAgent 和 defineSandboxAgent：Adapter 参考\"\nsidebarTitle: \"定义 Adapter\"\ndescription: \"defineAgent 和 defineSandboxAgent 参考：AgentContext、AgentSession、Sandbox 接口和共享 Sandbox 辅助函数。\"\n---\n\nimport { TurnRoundtrip } from '/snippets/diagram-turn-roundtrip.jsx';\n\n每个 [NiceEval](https://niceeval.com/) agent 都是一个 adapter：一段知道如何驱动特定 backend，并把输出转成标准事件流的代码。runner 只调用 `agent.send(input, ctx)`。\n\n<TurnRoundtrip />\n\n## `defineAgent`\n\n用于 direct agent 接入：\n\n```ts\nimport { completeEvidenceCoverage, defineAgent } from \"niceeval/adapter\";\n```\n\n`defineAgent` 产出的 `Agent.kind` 恒为 `\"direct\"`（内部判别字段，不用你声明）。`t` 上没有需要声明才解锁的能力位——`t.sandbox` 这类文件系统断言只在 `defineSandboxAgent` 构造的 Agent（`kind: \"sandbox\"`）上才有。其余由 `send` 实际返回的事件和 `ctx.session` 的使用决定，详见[能力位参考](/zh/reference/capabilities)。字段全集见下方「Agent 与 Adapter Context 字段」。\n\n### direct agent 示例\n\n```ts\nexport default defineAgent({\n  name: \"echo\",\n  evidenceCoverage: completeEvidenceCoverage,\n  async send(input) {\n    return {\n      status: \"completed\",\n      events: [{ type: \"message\", role: \"assistant\", text: input.text }],\n    };\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## `input`(`TurnInput`)\n\n<ResponseField name=\"text\" type=\"string\">\n  当前 `t.send(...)` 传入的文本。\n</ResponseField>\n\n<ResponseField name=\"files\" type=\"readonly InputFile[] | undefined\">\n  本轮附带的文件(图片等)。不支持多模态的 adapter 可以忽略它。\n</ResponseField>\n\n<ResponseField name=\"responses\" type=\"readonly InputResponse[] | undefined\">\n  仅回答轮(`t.respond` / `t.respondAll`)出现:逐请求的结构化回答,按 `requestId` 对位。\n</ResponseField>\n\n## `defineSandboxAgent`\n\n用于 coding agent CLI。产出的 `Agent.kind` 恒为 `\"sandbox\"`——`t.sandbox`、`t.sandbox.fileChanged()` 等文件系统断言只在这类 agent 上解锁。字段全集同样见下方「Agent 与 Adapter Context 字段」的 `SandboxAgentDef`。`ctx.sandbox`(`Sandbox` 接口)的完整方法见再下方「Sandbox 接口」。\n\n```ts\nimport { completeEvidenceCoverage, defineSandboxAgent } from \"niceeval/adapter\";\nimport { command } from \"niceeval/sandbox\";\n\nexport default defineSandboxAgent({\n  name: \"my-cli-agent\",\n  evidenceCoverage: completeEvidenceCoverage,\n  ensure: {\n    identity: { agent: \"my-cli-agent\", version: \"1.0.0\" },\n    probe: command(\"my-agent\", [\"--version\"]),\n  },\n  async send(input, ctx) {\n    await ctx.sandbox.runCommand(\"my-agent\", [\"run\", input.text]);\n    return { status: \"completed\", events: [] };\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## 注册\n\n```ts\nimport { defineExperiment } from \"niceeval\";\nimport echo from \"./agents/echo\";\n\nexport default defineExperiment({\n  agent: echo,\n  attempts: 1,\n});\n```\n\n## Agent 与 Adapter Context 字段\n\n`defineAgent`（`DirectAgentDef`）、`defineSandboxAgent`（`SandboxAgentDef`）的构造参数，\n以及两者的 `send(input, ctx)` 都会拿到的 `ctx`（`AgentContext`）：\n\n{/* GENERATED:BEGIN agent-def */}\n\n{/* 本区块由 pnpm docs:reference 从源码注释生成,勿手改;要改文案,改对应源码的 TSDoc/JSDoc(映射见 scripts/generate-reference.ts) */}\n\n### `DirectAgentDef`\n\n#### `name`\n\n```ts\nname: string;\n```\n\nagent 的显示名/标识,原样进入 `Agent.name`——不是注册表查找 key,只用于展示、结果归属与去重指纹。\n\n#### `evidenceCoverage`\n\n```ts\nevidenceCoverage: EvidenceCoverage;\n```\n\n该 Adapter 的常态证据覆盖声明；完整采集可用 `completeEvidenceCoverage`。\n\n#### `setup`\n\n```ts\nsetup?: DirectAgentSetup;\n```\n\n每个 attempt 一次。Direct Agent 不接收 Sandbox；常用于建立连接、鉴权等一次性准备。\n\n#### `tracing`\n\n```ts\ntracing?: Omit<AgentTracing, \"configure\">;\n```\n\nOTLP 导出配置:被测对象怎么把 trace 发到 endpoint(env-based 注入)。\n\n#### `spanMapper`\n\n```ts\nspanMapper?: SpanMapper;\n```\n\n原生 span → canonical 的薄 mapper;省略走通用 heuristic。只影响瀑布图。\n\n#### `send`\n\n```ts\nsend(input: TurnInput, ctx: AgentContext): Promise<Turn>;\n```\n\n每轮一次:把一轮 prompt 直接发给函数、SDK 或服务端点,解析响应成 events。\n\n#### `classifySendFailure`\n\n```ts\nclassifySendFailure?: SendFailureClassifier;\n```\n\n可选 send 执行失败分类器:见 `Agent.classifySendFailure`。\n\n#### `teardown`\n\n```ts\nteardown?: DirectAgentTeardown;\n```\n\n运行结束前的清理,当且仅当本 attempt 走到过 `setup` 时点才执行(`setup` 抛错不豁免),\n在 finally 里跑一次。\n\n### `SandboxAgentDef`\n\n#### `name`\n\n```ts\nname: string;\n```\n\nagent 的显示名/标识,原样进入 `Agent.name`——不是注册表查找 key,只用于展示、结果归属与去重指纹。\n\n#### `evidenceCoverage`\n\n```ts\nevidenceCoverage: EvidenceCoverage;\n```\n\n该 Adapter 的常态证据覆盖声明；完整采集可用 `completeEvidenceCoverage`。\n\n#### `ensure`\n\n```ts\nensure: AgentEnsure | readonly AgentEnsure[];\n```\n\n单条或数组都按声明顺序规范化为 Agent layer。\n\n#### `installers`\n\n```ts\ninstallers?: readonly AgentInstaller[];\n```\n\n配对安装层；省略表示这个 adapter 只提供 probe 协议，未命中时 Runner 在\n`agent.ensure` 点名缺失的精确 identity。工厂会把省略规范化成空数组。\n\n#### `setup`\n\n```ts\nsetup?: AgentSetup;\n```\n\n每条 Attempt 一次(不是每轮 send 一次):写 config.toml / 鉴权配置(model/base/auth 等\n本 Attempt 内不变的运行配置)。CLI 的 probe、安装与复检属于 `agent.ensure`。运行器在 Sandbox\n备好(layer prepare/ensure/baseline 之后)、第一次 send 前调用一次,不返回值。\n\n#### `tracing`\n\n```ts\ntracing?: AgentTracing;\n```\n\nOTLP 导出配置:Sandbox 里怎么让 CLI 把 trace 发到 endpoint(env / 配置文件),从 setup 拆出。\n\n#### `spanMapper`\n\n```ts\nspanMapper?: SpanMapper;\n```\n\n原生 span → canonical 的薄 mapper;省略走通用 heuristic。只影响瀑布图。\n\n#### `send`\n\n```ts\nsend(input: TurnInput, ctx: SandboxAgentContext): Promise<Turn>;\n```\n\n每轮一次:跑 prompt(fresh / resume)+ 解析成 events。\n\n#### `classifySendFailure`\n\n```ts\nclassifySendFailure?: SendFailureClassifier;\n```\n\n可选 send 执行失败分类器:见 `Agent.classifySendFailure`。\n\n#### `teardown`\n\n```ts\nteardown?: AgentTeardown;\n```\n\nSandbox 销毁前的清理,当且仅当本 attempt 走到过 `setup` 时点才执行(`setup` 抛错不豁免),\n在 finally 里跑一次。\n\n### `AgentContext`\n\n#### `signal`\n\n```ts\nreadonly signal: AbortSignal;\n```\n\n软取消信号:合并了 attempt 超时、run 级中断(用户 Ctrl+C)与评估用例自身的中断请求\n(见 src/runner/attempt.ts)。adapter 可以选择性检查它(或直接传给 `fetch`)以提前\n优雅退出,但这不是唯一的硬边界——即便 adapter 完全忽略它,运行器也会用\n`Effect.timeoutTo` 兜底强制收尾(停 Sandbox 容器)。\n\n#### `model`\n\n```ts\nreadonly model?: string;\n```\n\n本次 attempt 用的模型名,透传自 experiment 的 `model` 字段。sandbox 型 agent 通常在 setup 里用它写配置,direct 型通常在 send 里用它选模型。\n\n#### `reasoningEffort`\n\n```ts\nreadonly reasoningEffort?: string;\n```\n\n模型推理努力程度;归属同 model——实验决定,省略时不覆盖 agent 原生默认。\n\n#### `flags`\n\n```ts\nreadonly flags: Readonly<globalThis.Record<string, JsonValue>>;\n```\n\nexperiment 的 `flags` 字段原样透传,内容和结构完全由 experiment 作者自定义\n(如 `{ webResearch: true }`、`{ systemPrompt: \"...\" }`)。adapter 按自己的约定\n读取其中的字段;框架本身不解释、不校验它的内容。命名特意避开 CLI 解析出的\n`flag`(跑法层面的 --timeout/--budget 等),两者是不相关的概念。\n\n#### `experimentId`\n\n```ts\nreadonly experimentId?: string;\n```\n\n路径推导出的实验 id(与结果归属 `runWho` / `AgentRun.experimentId` 同源);不经\nexperiment 跑(如脱离 CLI、直接构造 `AgentRun` 的场景)时为 undefined。典型用途:\nSandboxLayer command 按","exit_code":0}},"command":{"kind":"command","original":{"state":"opaque","reason":"unsupported-protocol"},"logical":{"state":"opaque","normalizer":"logical-command/v1","reason":"original-opaque","originalReason":"unsupported-protocol"}},"start":{"turnOrdinal":2,"eventOrdinal":8},"lifecycle":{"state":"available","status":"completed","finish":{"turnOrdinal":2,"eventOrdinal":9}}},{"id":"[\"niceeval.logical-tool-occurrence/1\",\"session-1\",\"turn-2\",2,10]","session":"session-1","turn":"turn-2","name":{"original":"command_execution","canonical":"shell"},"input":{"state":"complete","value":{"command":"/bin/bash -lc \"rg -n \\\"class ResearchRequest|class.*Request|handle_start_command|def write_report|source_urls|report_source\\\" backend/server --glob '*.py' && sed -n '1,180p' frontend/nextjs/hooks/useWebSocket.ts && sed -n '400,445p' frontend/nextjs/app/page.tsx\""}},"output":{"state":"complete","value":{"output":"backend/server/app.py:53:class ResearchRequest(BaseModel):\nbackend/server/app.py:56:    report_source: str\nbackend/server/app.py:64:class ChatRequest(BaseModel):\nbackend/server/app.py:287:asy